```

meaning the art creator can pass `RoyaltyConfiguration({ royaltyBPS: 10_000, royaltyRecipient: artCreatorAddress }` as a parameter, effectively setting the royalty rate to 100%

This art creator is then free to monitor the mempool and frontrun any NFT sale from his creation by setting a royalty rate of 100%. The unsuspected seller will think he is selling with a royalty rate of the initial 5% but will in fact be robbed of the whole amount.

