The SHARE_LOCK_PERIOD in this line of code only takes into account the time of selling ShareCred, that is, you need to wait for a period of time after purchasing once, but there is no limit when you purchase multiple times.

According to the requirements of the project, buying and selling must take into account time limits, but this code only considers the time limit for selling, but not the time limit for buying. This will result in a large number of users trading during the buying period, while the selling users only have one transaction in a short period of time.
